<title>UK: JFS to launch 350 mln mark 3-year bond - leads.</title>
<headline>JFS to launch 350 mln mark 3-year bond - leads.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Finance Corp for Small Business (JFS) will launch a debut mark Eurobond, joint lead managers Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The expected issue size is 350 million marks, and a three-year maturity is likely. Price talk is around 8-10 basis points over the Bobl 112.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
